<title>USA: Fruit of the Loom Inc Q4 profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>Fruit of the Loom Inc Q4 profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr    profit	    $0.56     loss	 $4.05</p>
<p> Net    profit	   43,100     loss     308,000</p>
<p> Revs		     581,000		  508,800</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  76,900		   76,000</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q4 1995 net loss after $158.5 million writedown of goodwill.  </p>
<p>			YEAR</p>
<p> Shr     profit	   $1.98     loss	 $3.06</p>
<p> Net     profit	 151,200     loss     232,500</p>
<p> Revs		   2,447,400		2,403,100</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  76,400		   76,000</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Full-year 1995 net loss after $158.5 million writedown of goodwill and $5.2 milion or $0.07 a share charge for change in accounting for pre-operating costs.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
